{"4598740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "System Shutdown", "steam_appid": 4598740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System Shutdown is a 3D VR action hack and slash. Players can expect encounters with multiple enemies, where they must carefully maneuver around their attacks in order to take them out. This game is a work in progress and proof of concept for a future video game I wish to pursue creating in the future.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System Shutdown is a 3D VR action hack and slash. Players can expect encounters with multiple enemies, where they must carefully maneuver around their attacks in order to take them out. This game is a work in progress and proof of concept for a future video game I wish to pursue creating in the future.</p>", "short_description": "You play as Psiloh, a human weapon test subject trying to escape from the facility controlling him. You'll have to defeat the numerous enemies in your path in order to escape the facility, and find it's many hidden truths.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598740/db9b38c6bcb098f74a3958e65be7b2254513be3a/header.jpg?t=1777599662", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598740/ee45cdcf308143eac9c182e999f0bd64ba44e1b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777599662", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4598740/ee45cdcf308143eac9c182e999f0bd64ba44e1b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777599662", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Joshua Crow", "Sabrina Benton"], "publishers": ["Abilene Christian Unive